    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the weight of that 'you' go\"... i don't know. it feels more like there's nothing to let go of. it's just emptiness. like, if my whole life was built around us, and \"us\" is gone, then what's the point of maintaining the rest of this? i feel like i'm just wasting space.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
