      "content": "\"a very valid... kind of surrender.\" that's a heavy way to put it. it almost sounds like you're saying it's okay to just stop trying. like, if the structure is obsolete, why bother trying to rebuild it? it just seems so much easier to just... stop fighting the emptiness.",
